{"s": {"beats": [], "code": "game_star = thing(\"star\", x=-4.0, h=3.0, color=ORANGE)\ngta_lbl = text(\"GTA 6\", x=-4.0, y=2.5, size=1.05, style=\"title\", color=GOLD)\nenter(game_star, \"pop\")\nadd(gta_lbl)\npulse(game_star)\n\nwhen(\"over $1 billion in its first week\")\nvault = thing(\"bank\", x=3.8, h=3.2, color=BLUE)\nenter(vault, \"grow\")\namt = text(\"$0\", x=3.8, y=2.5, size=1.05, style=\"number\", color=GOLD)\nadd(amt)\ncount(amt, to=1, frm=0, prefix=\"$\", suffix=\" billion\", dur=1.2)\npile(\"coin\", n=8, x=3.8, size=0.55)\n\nwhen(\"actress playing Lucia\")\nactor = thing(\"microphone\", x=-0.2, h=2.6, color=TEAL)\nenter(actor, \"pop\")\nstar_lbl = text(\"STAR SHARE?\", x=-0.2, y=2.5, size=0.85, style=\"label\", color=CREAM)\nadd(star_lbl)\nsfx(\"ding\")\n\nwhen(\"flow down to its star\")\nmove(actor, to=(-1.4, -1.2), dur=0.7, arc=True)\nshake(actor)\n", "duration": 12.8, "narration": "GTA 6 is predicted to make over $1 billion in its first week, yet the actress playing Lucia almost certainly isn't a millionaire from it. Why doesn't a massive payday for a game company flow down to its star?", "objects": [{"id": "n0", "obj": "star"}, {"id": "n1", "obj": "bank"}, {"id": "n2", "obj": "coin"}, {"id": "n3", "obj": "microphone"}], "theme": "visual", "words": [["GTA", 0.0], ["6", 0.52], ["is", 0.88], ["predicted", 1.1], ["to", 1.46], ["make", 1.62], ["over", 1.84], ["$1", 2.1], ["billion", 2.4], ["in", 2.84], ["its", 3.16], ["first", 3.36], ["week,", 3.62], ["yet", 4.2], ["the", 4.28], ["actress", 4.46], ["playing", 4.7], ["Lucia", 5.08], ["almost", 5.54], ["certainly", 5.96], ["isn't", 6.32], ["a", 6.66], ["millionaire", 6.84], ["from", 7.2], ["it.", 7.46], ["Why", 8.1], ["doesn't", 8.28], ["a", 8.52], ["massive", 8.7], ["payday", 8.96], ["for", 9.44], ["a", 9.64], ["game", 9.74], ["company", 9.98], ["flow", 10.38], ["down", 10.66], ["to", 10.98], ["its", 11.14], ["star?", 11.34]]}, "script": 1, "v": true}